<title>CHINA: PT Bank Bali in US$50 mln FRCD club deal.</title>
<headline>PT Bank Bali in US$50 mln FRCD club deal.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Bank Bali's US$50 million floating rate certificate of deposit will be completed as a club deal via its Cayman Island Branch, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the facility has a final maturity of five years with no put or call options. The issue was priced at par to float at 85 basis points over the six-month London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Arrangement fee is 40 basis points.</p>
<p>Arrangers are Bali Regional Capital and Sanwa International Finance, bankers noted.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
